## How Nebius is used
- **Nebius Token Factory** for all Nemotron chat inference (planning, sufficiency check, answer) and for embeddings.
- Deployment path: Docker container on a **Nebius AI Cloud** VM (instructions in README; not yet deployed or tested by the author).

## Impact
Helps people produce research they can defend: every claim traceable, uncertainty visible.

## Roadmap
Evaluation harness on labelled questions, reranking, OCR, persistent vector store, PDF export, authentication, streaming.

